    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9495" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνταπο-στέλλω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>send in exchange,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμήρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					21.43.22
				</span></i>
			; <i>send backwards and forwards,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρέσβεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					50.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				31.9
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); <i>refer</i> one <i>back again,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					8.86
				</span></i>
			; of an echo, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἀνακλάσεις ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.248c
				</span></i>
			.</div>
